From 1ae61726ad70bc8d17d881d6a4906d040f4a2ae0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@soprasteria.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:50:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Gate the Lunal take skip on the runtime mode

The previous correction used borg_cfg[BORG_MUNCHKIN_START], which is a
class/config flag: for Warrior, Druid and Ranger it is true for the whole
game, so the skip was disabled everywhere for those classes - including the
Lunal path the defect was reported for - and the Warrior cohort could never
exercise it.

Use borg.munchkin_mode instead: the skip is active outside munchkin mode for
every class, and inactive only while the borg is actually collecting to
sell.
---
 src/borg/borg-flow-take.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-flow-take.c b/src/borg/borg-flow-take.c
index a2523f6e2..40ec8b830 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-flow-take.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-flow-take.c
@@ -839,7 +839,7 @@ bool borg_flow_take_lunal(bool viewable, int nearness)
         }
 
         /* Skip items the Borg does not want */
-        if (item_bad)
+        if (item_bad && !borg.munchkin_mode)
             continue;
 
         /* Get the grid */
